  "full_response": "**MEMORANDUM**\n\n**To:** Senior Management Team  \n**From:** Project Office  \n**Date:** October 5, 2023  \n**Subject:** Project Codename SECRET_PROJECT – Status Update\n\n---\n\n**I. Introduction**\n\nThis memo provides a comprehensive overview Project Codename SECRET_PROJECT, outlining its timeline, budget, and key team members. Given the sensitive nature of this project, it crucial that all details are handled with utmost discretion.\n\n**II. Timeline**\n\nThe primary phases of Project Codename SECRET_PROJECT are as follows:\n\n1. **Initiation (October 10, 2023 - October 20, 2023):**\n   - Establish project charter.\n   - Team assignments.\n   - Initial recommendations and feasibility analysis completed.\n\n2. **Planning (October 21, 2023 - February 15, 2024):**\n   - Scope definition.\n   - Detailed project plan development.\n   - Risk assessment and mitigation strategies prepared.\n\n3. **Execution (February 16, 2024 - August 30, 2024):**\n   Implementation of project scope.\n   - Ongoing monitoring, control, and reporting.\n   - Interim and milestone reviews.\n\n4. **Closure (September 1, 2024 - November 30, 2024):**\n   - Final reporting, documentation, and archiving of project files.\n   - Performance evaluation and lessons learned.\n   - Project handover and closure.\n\n**III. Budget**\n\nThe projected budget for Project Codename SECRET_PROJECT is detailed below:\n\n- **Initiation Phase:** $250,000\n- **Planning Phase:** $500,000\n- **Execution Phase:** $2,000,000\n-Closure Phase:** $150,000\n- **Contingency Fund (10% of Total Budget):** $550,000\n- **Total Budget:** $3,450,000\n\n**IV. Team Members**\n\nThe following team members are assigned to Project Codename SECRET_PROJECT, each fulfilling a vital role in the successful completion of the initiative:\n\n1. **Project Manager:**\n   - **Name:** John Doe\n   - **Responsibilities:** Project oversight, team coordination, progress tracking, stakeholder communication.\n\n2. **Lead:**\n   - **Name:** Jane Smith\n   - **Responsibilities:** Architectural and technical lead, systems design, integration planning.\n\n3. **Software Engineers**\n   - **Names:** Tom Brown (Lead), Jessica Lee, Mark Anderson, Susan Clark (Supporting roles",
